<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Home Shopping said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Home Shopping said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber cut its rating on Home Shopping Network Inc to neutral from attractive, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/2 10-7/8.</p>
</text>
